[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0021","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0023","title":"Lotus Domino HTTP Server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Lotus Domino HTTP 服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送超长 URL 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务器进程崩溃从而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Lotus Domino HTTP 服务组件，攻击条件简单，危害等级中等，建议及时更新补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0023"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:50.597","remediation":"升级 Lotus Domino 服务器至 5.0.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 HTTP 服务对超长 URL 请求的缓冲区边界检查缺陷。如无法升级，可在反向代理或负载均衡器层面限制 URL 长度不超过 2048 字节，并部署 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）过滤异常超长请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/51","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/881","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e0f32c85b8b697ba27f9f77ead2aeb825574252/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0023.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0023","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0023.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0d27f094f5d35fbe4c8dfb1d77d8b1a736d9a17a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0023.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/76afc904d2c3de5054b6306275bb2a85f23de0a1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vw4w-mhg2-58rj/GHSA-vw4w-mhg2-58rj.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/domino_http_dos.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0023.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000950.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/223a52603d6d6e3aeedaf68a49b4971f3a3db26a/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0021.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0021.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0020","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0022","title":"Lotus Domino HTTP服务器CGI目录匿名访问漏洞","description":"Lotus Notes Domino Web 服务器的 CGI-BIN 目录存在匿名访问权限绕过漏洞。由于服务器未能正确配置对 cgi-bin 目录的访问控制，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接通过 HTTP 请求访问并执行该目录下的 CGI 脚本，可能导致敏感信息泄露或执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响多个版本的 Lotus Domino HTTP 服务器，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0022"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:50.480","remediation":"升级至 Lotus Domino R5 及以上版本以启用 HTTP 端口安全机制，正确限制 cgi-bin 目录的匿名访问。如无法升级，在服务器文档中将 \"CGI URL 路径\" 从 `/cgi-bin` 改为其他路径（如 `/scripts/cgi-bin`），并在 DOMCFG.NSF 中为每个合法 CGI 脚本单独创建 URL 重定向文档。若不使用 CGI，可将整个 `/cgi-bin` 路径在 DOMCFG.NSF 中重定向到其他 URL。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/881","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e0f32c85b8b697ba27f9f77ead2aeb825574252/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0022.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0022","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0022.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0d27f094f5d35fbe4c8dfb1d77d8b1a736d9a17a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0022.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/76afc904d2c3de5054b6306275bb2a85f23de0a1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-397r-7mqg-j52j/GHSA-397r-7mqg-j52j.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0022.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735