0358"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-03T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:33.060","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Linux 至 6.2 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 Red Hat 安全公告 RHSA-1999:058-01 中修复。具体操作：运行 `rpm -q ORBit gnome-session` 确认当前版本，若 ORBit 版本低于 0.5.0-8 或 gnome-session 版本低于 1.0.4-4，则通过 `rpm -Uvh` 安装更新包。由于 Red Hat Linux 6.x 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 发行版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/corp/support/errata/RHSA1999058-01.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0358.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0358","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0358.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0358.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j98r-5mcr-2hm4/GHSA-j98r-5mcr-2hm4.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0358.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a4f3062b-007a-4749-995b-d9d4eaeb8fa8.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0369.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0368","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0368.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0357","title":"Red Hat Linux ORBit 和 esound 弱认证漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.1 中 ORBit 和 esound 组件在生成认证密钥时使用了弱随机数，导致本地攻击者可通过暴力枚举或预测方式猜测认证密钥，从而绕过身份验证机制获取未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.1 系统，攻击者需具备本地用户权限，成功利用后可获取系统敏感信息或执行未授权操作。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0357"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-03T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:32.937","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Linux 至 6.2 或更高版本，该版本修复了 ORBit 和 esound 随机数生成强度不足的问题。由于 Red Hat Linux 6.1 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 发行版，并确保系统安全补丁保持最新。如无法升级，可限制本地用户对 esound 服务的访问权限，通过配置文件 /etc/esd.conf 设置仅允许受信任用户连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/corp/support/errata/RHSA1999058-01.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0357.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0357","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0357.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0357.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h6jr-3rrj-gv5c/GHSA-h6jr-3rrj-gv5c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0357.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1275/info.html","https://github.com/dedis/bib/blob/179d196355a7de4db7bdca91457520b1569f65c2/sec.bib","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0368.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0124","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0124.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0139","title":"True North Software Internet Anywhere Mail Server 3.1.3 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"True North Software Internet Anywhere Mail Server 3.1.3 的 POP3 服务在处理畸形的 RETR 命令时存在缺陷，认证后的本地攻击者可通过向邮件服务器发送特制的 RETR 请求导致服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用条件要求攻击者拥有有效认证凭据，影响仅限于邮件服务的可用性，不会导致数据泄露或远程代码执行。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0139"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1999-12-03","updated":"2024-11-20","remediation":"该产品已停止维护多年且无官方补丁。建议在 POP3 服务入口（如防火墙或 xinetd）中对 RETR 命令参数做长度与格式校验以拦截畸形请求，同时严格限制本地用户对邮件服务器的访问权限，并考虑迁移至仍在维护的邮件服务器软件（如 Dovecot）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95021326417936&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/982"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0124.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0380","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0380.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0366","title":"Debian GNU/Linux 2.1 dump 符号链接还原漏洞","description":"Debian GNU/Linux 2.1 系统中的 dump 备份还原工具在处理符号链接时存在权限验证缺陷，未能正确恢复符号链接的所有权属性。本地攻击者可通过在备份文件中构造恶意的符号链接，在还原过程中利用该漏洞将任意文件的所有权修改为其他用户，从而实现对系统文件的非授权篡改。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0366"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-02T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:34.033","remediation":"升级 Debian GNU/Linux 至 3.0 或更高版本，其中 dump 已修复符号链接处理逻辑。如无法升级，限制本地用户对 dump 命令的执行权限（chmod 750 /sbin/dump），并仅授予可信用户本地 shell 访问权限以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/1999/19991202","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1442","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0366.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0366","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0366.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0366.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ece131eb82ceb38a160571408bcbbb92bfa0f3c0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p5vp-x555-wmc3/GHSA-p5vp-x555-wmc3.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0366.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000915.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0380.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0019","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0021","title":"Lotus Domino HTTP Server 路径泄露漏洞","description":"Lotus Domino HTTP 服务器存在路径信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者通过向 /cgi-bin 目录发送请求访问不存在的脚本，服务器返回的错误信息中会泄露 Web 服务的真实物理路径。攻击者利用此信息可进一步探测系统目录结构，为后续攻击收集情报。该漏洞影响 Lotus Domino Web Server 多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0021"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:50.360","remediation":"升级至 Lotus Domino 5.0.1 及以上版本，该版本已