攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求读取任意可执行文件源码，为后续深入攻击提供信息支撑。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0004"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-01T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:48.240","remediation":"立即升级到 ZBServer 最新版本。如已停止维护，建议迁移至 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx 等活跃维护的 Web 服务器。如无法立即更换，应在 Web 服务器前端配置反向代理或 WAF（如 ModSecurity），拦截含 \".\" 的可执行文件请求路径；同时在防火墙层面限制对 ZBServer 端口的访问来源 IP，仅允许可信网络访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94606572912422&w=2","http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind9912&L=NTBUGTRAQ&P=R3556","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0004.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0004","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0004.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0004.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x8rm-jcqv-qh7g/GHSA-x8rm-jcqv-qh7g.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88260/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0004.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-41.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--833b202d-5e55-4f68-85fa-788bff23a5c3.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0006.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0441","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0441.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0531","title":"Caldera OpenLinux Red Hat Linux SCO eServer gpm 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux gpm 程序在处理 /dev/gpmctl 设备时存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该设备大量发送 STREAM sockets 连接请求，耗尽系统资源导致服务拒绝。该漏洞影响 OpenLinux 2.3/2.4、RedHat 6.0/6.1、SCO eServer 2.3 等 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 2.1（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于本地拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，仅影响系统可用性。攻击者可通过向 /dev/gpmctl 设备文件大量发送 STREAM socket 连接请求，耗尽系统文件描述符或内存资源，导致 gpm 服务或整个系统无法响应合法请求，造成拒绝服务。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0531"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:56.170","remediation":"受影响系统请升级至厂商发布的安全补丁版本：OpenLinux 用户升级至 gpm 1.20.1 或更高版本，RedHat 用户应用 RHSA-2000-045 安全更新，SCO 用户升级至 eServer 维护版本。如无法立即升级，可暂时关闭 gpm 服务（执行 `service gpm stop` 或 `systemctl disable gpm`），并移除 `/dev/gpmctl` 设备文件的写入权限（`chmod 600 /dev/gpmctl`），仅允许 root 用户访问，以缓解本地拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0409.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-045.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1377","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.10.10006201453090.1812-200000%40apollo.aci.com.pl","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5010","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20026","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0531.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0531","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0531.md","htt