的 RTF 文件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0073"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-17T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:56.680","remediation":"受影响系统均已终止支持且无官方补丁。建议升级到 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2019/2022 等受支持版本；若无法升级，应在邮件客户端和应用中禁用 RTF 格式渲染，改用纯文本模式处理富文本内容，并限制用户打开来源不明的 .rtf 文件（如通过组策略启用附件管理器阻止 rtf 扩展名）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ249973","http://xforce.iss.net/search.php3?type=2&pattern=win-malformed-rtf-control-word","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-005","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19633","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0073.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4382b0b8593e7ef30616ab300314afbbf1571636/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0073.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0073","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0073.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0073.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29756569ae7c866e39492d6faf2dcdff310590f7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hp77-39hv-xf39/GHSA-hp77-39hv-xf39.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0073.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"